Инструкция по загрузки Docker registry Яндекс облака
- Установки CLI: curl -sSL https://storage.yandexcloud.net/yandexcloud-yc/install.sh | bash (https://yandex.cloud/ru/docs/cli/operations/install-cli)

- Создание профиля: (https://yandex.cloud/ru/docs/cli/operations/profile/profile-create#yandex-account_1)
    - yc config profile create test
    - yc config set folder-id b1g21id6bcefmvt4ktbc (b1g21id6bcefmvt4ktbc - id каталога) https://console.yandex.cloud/folders/b1g21id6bcefmvt4ktbc
    - yc init - настройку профиля CLI
        Welcome! This command will take you through the configuration process.
        Pick desired action:
        [1] Re-initialize this profile 'test' with new settings 
        [2] Create a new profile
        Please enter your numeric choice: 1
        Please go to https://oauth.yandex.ru/authorize?response_type=token&client_id=1a6990aa636648e9b2ef855fa7bec2fb in order to obtain OAuth token.
        Please enter OAuth token: y0__xDM17uLARjB3RMg7Oeh1hXG2AN-pr6YhkkhndcS_vNr57insQ
        You have one cloud available: 'cloud-oleg-manzhay' (id = b1g3a3i0fgpc8rekglrh). It is going to be used by default.
        Please choose folder to use:
        [1] default (id = b1gvkhufmti0jdoakccc) 
        [2] dockerregistry (id = b1g21id6bcefmvt4ktbc)
        [3] registry (id = b1gmkg7r8tp34lc7rbhq)
        [4] Create a new folder
        Please enter your numeric choice: 2
        Your current folder has been set to 'dockerregistry' (id = b1g21id6bcefmvt4ktbc).
        Do you want to configure a default Compute zone? [Y/n] y
        Which zone do you want to use as a profile default?
        [1] ru-central1-a
        [2] ru-central1-b
        [3] ru-central1-d
        [4] Don't set default zone
        Please enter your numeric choice: 1
        Your profile default Compute zone has been set to 'ru-central1-a'.

        - Получили токен: https://oauth.yandex.ru/verification_code y0__xDM17uLARjB3RMg7Oeh1hXG2AN-pr6YhkkhndcS_vNr57insQ
        - echo y0__xDM17uLARjB3RMg7Oeh1hXG2AN-pr6YhkkhndcS_vNr57insQ|docker login   --username oauth   --password-stdin  cr.yandex

    - yc config list - проверка конфигии
        token: y0__xDM17uLARjB3RMg7Oeh1hXG2AN-pr6YhkkhndcS_vNr57insQ
        cloud-id: b1g3a3i0fgpc8rekglrh
        folder-id: b1g21id6bcefmvt4ktbc
        compute-default-zone: ru-central1-a

- Создание реестра (https://yandex.cloud/ru/docs/container-registry/quickstart/?from=int-console-help&utm_referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fnetology-code%2Fvirtd-homeworks%2Fblob%2Fshvirtd-1%2F05-virt-04-docker-in-practice%2FREADME.md)
    - yc container registry create --name my-first-registry
        done (1s)
        id: crpvstcq03e9l7aj0lfe
        folder_id: b1g21id6bcefmvt4ktbc
        name: my-first-registry
        status: ACTIVE
        created_at: "2025-12-15T08:38:21.534Z"
    
- Конфигурация Docker для работы с yandex registry
   - yc container registry configure-docker

- Работа с образами
    - Скачайте Docker-образ из репозитория Docker Hub:
        docker pull ubuntu
    - Присвойте скачанному Docker-образу тег вида cr.yandex/<идентификатор_реестра>/<имя_Docker-образа>:<тег>: (id реестра: crpvstcq03e9l7aj0lfe)
        docker tag ubuntu cr.yandex/<идентификатор_реестра>/ubuntu:hello

    - Загрузите Docker-образ в репозиторий Container Registry:
        docker push cr.yandex/<идентификатор_реестра>/ubuntu:hello (id реестра: crpvstcq03e9l7aj0lfe)

    - Запустите Docker-образ
        docker run cr.yandex/<идентификатор_реестра>/ubuntu:hello (id реестра: crpvstcq03e9l7aj0lfe)


Инструкция по работе с terraform
https://yandex.cloud/ru/docs/tutorials/infrastructure-management/terraform-quickstart#cli_1
Создание нового каталога в облаке через web-console
    terraform b1g9nvupbq7mc7ucr9h4
Переключение сервисного 
    yc config set folder-id b1g9nvupbq7mc7ucr9h4
Создание сервисного аккаунта 
    yc iam service-account create --name sa-terraform
Результат:
    done (3s)
    id: aje5ov2ku1tg2ht40v98
    folder_id: b1g9nvupbq7mc7ucr9h4
    created_at: "2026-01-16T06:53:31Z"
    name: sa-terraform

Назначение роли для ServiceAccoun
    yc resource-manager folder add-access-binding b1g9nvupbq7mc7ucr9h4 \
    --role admin \
    --subject serviceAccount:aje5ov2ku1tg2ht40v98
Результат:
    done (2s)
effective_deltas:
  - action: ADD
    access_binding:
      role_id: admin
      subject:
        id: aje5ov2ku1tg2ht40v98
        type: serviceAccount

export YC_TOKEN=$(yc iam create-token --impersonate-service-account-id aje5ov2ku1tg2ht40v98)
export YC_CLOUD_ID=$(yc config get cloud-id)
export YC_FOLDER_ID=$(yc config get folder-id)

echo $YC_TOKEN
echo $YC_CLOUD_ID
echo $YC_FOLDER_ID
